sequenceDiagram
    participant A as ReActAgent._execute_tool()
    participant H as HITLGuard
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant U as 管理员

    A->>H: check("send_email", {...})
    H->>H: HIGH_RISK_ACTIONS 命中
    H->>A: PendingAction(requires_approval=True)
    A->>A: 返回"等待审批"原因
    Note over U: 管理员查看待审批列表
    U->>API: GET /agent/actions/pending
    API->>H: list_pending()
    H->>API: [PendingAction(send_email)]
    API->>U: {actions: [send_email]}
    Note over U: 管理员审批
    U->>API: POST /agent/actions/{id}/approve
    API->>H: approve(id)
    H->>API: OK
    API->>U: {status: "approved"}